#: ../source_code.rst:32 f284defa2fbc44c5ade87020d2d58f20
msgid "Third-party libraries"
msgstr "Bibliotecas de terceros"

#: ../source_code.rst:34 19742e27a01145019d9d751af6da4473
msgid ""
"Galette's third-party dependencies are not included in the repository. "
"Instead, PHP dependencies are handled with `Composer dependency manager "
"<https://getcomposer.org>`_ and JavaScript ones with `Node Package Manager "
"(npm) <https://npmjs.com>`_ and `gulp <https://gulpjs.com/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Las dependencias de terceros de Galette no se incluyen en el repositorio. En "
"su lugar, las dependencias de PHP se gestionan con `Composer dependency "
"manager <https://getcomposer.org>`_ y las de JavaScript con `Node Package "
"Manager (npm) <https://npmjs.com>`_ y `gulp <https://gulpjs.com/>`_."

